      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>The rebuilder no longer has this issue; it has been modified to NOT attempt early detection of duplicate objects in file storage during a rebuild.  When such a situation occurs, it causes an error and requires manual cleanup.</p>",
